3. The warmup phase corresponds to approximately 5 * (14096/1024) = ~70 steps, so compute total steps as epochs * steps_per_epoch and set warmup_steps=70. Apply scheduler after each optimizer step and keep all other training loop structures unchanged."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
