near warmup to a cosine annealing scheduler with a linear warmup phase for 5 epochs. This directly addresses the observed plateau by providing aggressive early exploration and smooth convergence, as successful historical experiments showed. Implementation: import torch.optim.lr_scheduler.CosineAnnealingLR; set warmup_epochs=5, compute total_steps, and after warmup use cosine annealing to 0. Keep batch size, gradient clipping, early stopping patience (5), and label smoothing unchanged."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
