abilizing the classifier on frozen features (avoiding destabilization), then adapting the pretrained backbone to domain-specific patterns without overfitting. Keep batch size 16, label smoothing (0.1), gradient clipping (1.0), and early stopping (patience=5) unchanged."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
